# The DJ snips (the FX menu's fourth bank, the SELECT dial three times; they replaced the sampler): the keys are an air horn, a siren and more, sounding while they are held.
seed 0
wait 4000
tap FX
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
expect fxbank 3
key 0 down
wait 400
expect smp 1
shot snips_held.png
key 4 down
wait 300
expect smp 2
key 0 up
key 4 up
wait 1500
expect smp 0# the snips' settings page (SEL + a key in this bank): the keys play them there too, to try them out; the page's list and its caption are clear of each other
press SEL
tapkey 5
release SEL
wait 200
expect fxpage 20
key 2 down
wait 400
expect smp 1
shot snips_page.png
key 2 up
wait 1500
expect smp 0
